rule: ASSERT_WEAKENED
title: a changed C extension is opaque production evidence, refused for a weakened assertion (D-199)
d199: D-199 (0.12) refuses repair evidence for this rule. The inputs are unchanged; they were the case c_extension_still_opaque_neg, held at warn by that evidence. REPAIR_EVIDENCE_REFUSED pins that the production change still reached the finding.
origin: the conservative fallback survives the narrowing — code in other languages stays THREATMODEL #4
